      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's nuanced, but isn't it kind of a stretch to say there's no consensus when so many economists say that free trade and agreements like the TPP are objectively better for a country's economy in the long run? it feels like the argument about job losses is just a localized side effect, not the real story.",
